      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name} I did some digging and I'm fairly certain you could replicate this behaviour from within Steam Input components alone.\n\nThough in case you can't, I suppose they could just leave this \"menu\" keybind in to maintain that functionality and add a second \"quick_menu\" bind that doesn't have the hold gesture baked in? That might be best.",
