      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd love to see these separated into two different bindings. Even if vrchat is doing the opening delay. That makes it possible to open up buttons for other things in overlays.\n\nI, for example, only uses my action menu on my right hand and only opens the menu on my left. Since I have way more dexterity in my right hand. That would open up button click for a gesture or something on my right and long hold for resetting my playspace on my left menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
